    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d455-a1">

                <pb facs="0626" n="530" xml:id="pg530"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 52.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Hohrannes Khan to Mr. Hardy.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran, Persia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-02-27"><hi rendition="#italic">February 27,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: We have received a telegram from his
                    excellency the Emir-i-Nizam, dated 25th of February, saying that the indemnity
                    of 200 tomans due to Mr. Bagdasarian has been paid to the English consulate at
                    Tabriz.</p>
                <p>I am glad to see justice done to Bagdasarian and this question closed, as all
                    others pending between the foreign office and the American legation.</p>
                <p>Yours, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hohrannes.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
